# =========================================================================
# Google Sign-In Client Configuration
# =========================================================================
# To enable real Google Login using active Gmail accounts:
# 
# 1. Create a Google Cloud Developer Project at https://console.cloud.google.com/
# 2. Configure an OAuth Consent Screen and create a Client ID for a Web Application.
# 3. Add "http://localhost:5173" to the "Authorized JavaScript origins".
# 4. Paste your generated client ID below (replace the placeholder).
# 5. Restart your client terminal dev server after saving this file.
# =========================================================================

VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-actual-google-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
